{
  "title": "Viz",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Light shows on a",
        "grid for whatever",
        "Move is playing.",
        "",
        "Viz lights a 203",
        "Systems Matrix on",
        "the USB-A port. It",
        "follows Move's",
        "clock when Move",
        "plays, and the",
        "sound when it is",
        "stopped.",
        "",
        "It never changes",
        "the audio."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Setting up",
      "lines": [
        "1. Plug the Matrix",
        "into USB-A.",
        "2. On the Matrix,",
        "open Performance",
        "(the red app).",
        "3. Load Viz into",
        "Master FX.",
        "",
        "Dark grid? Unplug",
        "the Matrix and",
        "plug it back in.",
        "",
        "To light up to",
        "Move's own sounds,",
        "turn on Move to",
        "Schwung in Global",
        "Settings. Schwung",
        "modules always",
        "reach Viz.",
        "",
        "Touching the grid",
        "plays the Move's",
        "selected track.",
        "",
        "Drums lighting",
        "pads? Set the Move",
        "track's MIDI out",
        "channel to 7 or",
        "higher. The Matrix",
        "ignores those.",
        "If the track plays",
        "a Schwung synth,",
        "set its Recv Ch to",
        "match."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Power",
      "lines": [
        "The USB-A port",
        "cannot power a",
        "fully bright grid.",
        "Too much light and",
        "the Matrix locks up",
        "until replugged.",
        "",
        "POWER Port (the",
        "default) keeps",
        "every frame within",
        "what the port can",
        "give, at any Matrix",
        "brightness.",
        "",
        "POWER Hub lifts the",
        "limit. Use it only",
        "with a powered USB",
        "hub."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Lights off",
      "lines": [
        "Removing Viz keeps",
        "the last picture",
        "on the grid. Turn",
        "LIGHT to 0 first,",
        "or replug the grid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Launchpads",
      "lines": [
        "Set GRID to your",
        "Launchpad: Mini",
        "MK3, X, Pro MK3,",
        "MK2 or Pro.",
        "",
        "Untested: built",
        "from Novation's",
        "guides, not on a",
        "real Launchpad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Look",
      "lines": [
        "SCENE: 100 shapes,",
        "then 6 soft ones.",
        "COLOR: the colour",
        "set.",
        "RATE: how often it",
        "steps, 1 bar to",
        "1/16.",
        "SIZE: shapes 1 to",
        "4 pads big.",
        "TRAIL: how long",
        "lights linger.",
        "FOLD: mirror the",
        "corner: Sides, Top,",
        "Four or Eight.",
        "SHIFT: swap colours",
        "each bar, beat or",
        "kick, or Hold.",
        "REACT: what a kick",
        "does: Glow, Grow,",
        "Flash or Flip."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Settings",
      "lines": [
        "MODE: Auto follows",
        "the clock while",
        "Move plays and the",
        "sound when stopped.",
        "Beat: clock only.",
        "Sound: sound only.",
        "Blend: clock, with",
        "the sound twice as",
        "strong.",
        "",
        "LIGHT: brightness.",
        "GRID: which grid.",
        "CYCLE: bars between",
        "scene changes (in",
        "a later version).",
        "TURN: rotate.",
        "EDGE: underglow.",
        "NUDGE: lights",
        "earlier or later."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
